  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use almost any weapon in a lashing, graceful dance of death.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Mythic Weapon Finesse, Weapon Focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use Weapon Finesse with any one-handed melee weapon or two-handed reach weapon with which you have Weapon Focus. You cannot use Weapon Finesse with two-handed weapons that do not have reach.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc148\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
